sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User
    participant Front as Frontend (Next.js)
    participant Back as Backend (Express API)
    participant ML as ML Model (Transformers)
    participant DB as Database (Firestore)

    User->>Front: Submits structured journal text and emoji
    activate Front
    Front->>Back: POST /analyzeMood { text, emojiScore }
    activate Back
    Back->>ML: getAugmentedMoodScore()
    activate ML
    ML-->>Back: Returns NLP-computed moodScore
    deactivate ML
    Back-->>Front: 200 OK { moodScore }
    deactivate Back
    
    Front->>DB: Save MoodEntry (text, emojiScore, moodScore, info)
    activate DB
    DB-->>Front: Acknowledge document creation
    deactivate DB
    
    Front-->>User: Update user interface / Redirect view
    deactivate Front
